{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Stalemate","artist":"Death Note: The Musical","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:056","sourceHash":"acca626f48b7828767d67482b86be34810e8e02272db09ecb2bbae2c77b04cbb","duration":201.02,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.08517,"end":7.44,"text":"Each time I challenge he responds","translation":"내가 도전할 때마다 녀석은 응수해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.500045,"end":11.26,"text":"He takes the bait as if he's taunting me","translation":"날 조롱하듯 미끼를 물어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.319728,"end":14.696,"text":"He waves a hundred magic wands","translation":"마법 지팡이 백 개를 휘두르면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":14.756281,"end":18.69,"text":"And soon a hundred men just cease to be","translation":"곧 백 명의 남자가 사라져 버려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":18.750113,"end":21.511,"text":"I haven't figured out just how","translation":"아직 그 수법은 알아내지 못했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":21.571338,"end":25.343,"text":"He doesn't kill them with a knife or gun","translation":"칼이나 총으로 죽이는 건 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":25.40263,"end":28.28,"text":"But if you ask me here and now","translation":"그래도 지금 여기서 내게 묻는다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":30.197551,"end":34.39,"text":"I'm pretty sure Kira is your son","translation":"키라는 아마 당신 아들이 확실해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":41.273469,"end":43.0,"text":"I wonder if this guy's for real","translation":"이 남자 진짜일까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":43.792834,"end":46.39,"text":"I wonder is he who he claims to be","translation":"정말 자신이 말하는 그 사람일까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":46.764989,"end":48.69,"text":"And if he is, then what's the deal?","translation":"그렇다면 대체 속셈이 뭐지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":49.586213,"end":52.27,"text":"Why would he make a point of telling me?","translation":"왜 굳이 내게 정체를 알렸을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":52.837007,"end":55.21,"text":"He doesn't rattle easily","translation":"쉽게 동요하지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.890431,"end":57.93,"text":"He's such a calm and cool collected guy","translation":"아주 침착하고 냉정한 녀석이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":58.421406,"end":60.11,"text":"And if he kills while he's with me","translation":"나와 함께 있을 때 살인을 저지른다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":61.35873,"end":63.16,"text":"Like it or not, I have his alibi","translation":"싫든 좋든 내가 녀석의 알리바이지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":65.689252,"end":71.17,"text":"All or nothing so let's get to it","translation":"전부 아니면 전무야 시작하자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":71.238821,"end":73.76,"text":"This time's stalemate but","translation":"이번엔 교착 상태지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":74.605714,"end":76.48,"text":"Just you wait","translation":"두고 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.229569,"end":79.9,"text":"Clock is ticking so","translation":"시계는 계속 가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":80.097234,"end":82.47,"text":"Let's just do it","translation":"그냥 해보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":83.208707,"end":84.37,"text":"Let's begin, thick or thin, lose or win","translation":"시작해 좋든 나쁘든 지든 이기든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":84.509025,"end":90.43,"text":"This is it!","translation":"바로 지금이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":93.320998,"end":95.08,"text":"His name is obviously fake","translation":"그의 이름은 분명 가짜야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":96.432472,"end":98.44,"text":"So he inoculates himself from me","translation":"그래서 내 손에서 자신을 지켜","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":98.800907,"end":100.66,"text":"He's waiting for my first mistake","translation":"내 첫 실수를 기다리고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":101.459592,"end":104.41,"text":"So I'll wait also but more patiently","translation":"나도 기다리지 조금 더 끈기 있게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":104.675556,"end":106.47,"text":"Just like two actors on a stage","translation":"무대 위 두 배우처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":107.61288,"end":109.65,"text":"Go through the motions that we both rehearse","translation":"함께 연습한 동작을 되풀이해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":110.399274,"end":112.68,"text":"Our little new atomic age","translation":"우리만의 새로운 원자력 시대","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":113.568798,"end":114.54,"text":"Eyeball to eyeball","translation":"눈과 눈을 마주하고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":114.648526,"end":118.11,"text":"We'll see who blinks first","translation":"누가 먼저 눈을 깜박이나 보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":120.825034,"end":122.97,"text":"All or nothing so let's get to it","translation":"전부 아니면 전무야 시작하자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":124.064218,"end":125.31,"text":"This time's stalemate but","translation":"이번엔 교착 상태지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":132.121542,"end":134.45,"text":"Let's just do it","translation":"그냥 해보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":135.082086,"end":136.88,"text":"No taboos, light the fuse, win or lose","translation":"금기는 없어 도화선에 불을 붙여 이기든 지든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":155.817506,"end":156.59,"text":"This is it!","translation":"바로 지금이야","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}